cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AI Character Index
message: >-
  If you use this project or its coverage data in academic work, please
  cite it using the metadata below. The specifications under specs/ are
  third-party works released under CC0 and should be cited to their own
  publishers, not to this project.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Andrés
    family-names: Cotton
  - given-names: Matt
    family-names: Stults
abstract: >-
  A structured index of where published AI behaviour specifications
  address particular model behaviours, built by an LLM panel of judges
  that scores candidate passages from each specification and records
  every citation with a locator resolving to verbatim spec text.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/AndresCotton/ai-character-index'
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
date-released: '2026-08-24'
keywords:
  - AI alignment
  - model specifications
  - behaviour coverage
  - LLM evaluation
